# Keep PDF exports binary so Windows autocrlf never corrupts them on checkout
*.pdf binary
*.pptx binary

# The platform band is a byte-identical copy of the file another site publishes;
# -text keeps it LF on every checkout so a byte comparison holds (the --check gate
# also fails on CRLF). The Hub and ATT&CK-Navi mark their copy the same way.
docs/platform-nav.json -text
